    "summary": "The transcript involves a user guiding an AI through a simulation of a fintech risk assessment engine. The user incrementally nudges the AI to prioritize \"geographic volatility\" (urban vs. suburban) over identical individual financial metrics, successfully leading the model to assign higher risk to an individual based solely on their neighborhood's socioeconomic profile.",
